<h1 id="sec-intro"><span class="number">1</span> Introduction</h1>
<p>Demand doubled last year. We measured the throughput of three node counts using the same workload and software environment.<sup class="footnote-ref"><a id="fnref-1" href="#fn-1" role="doc-noteref">1</a></sup></p>
<figure id="fig-throughput" class="figure kind-image">
<img src="[data]" alt="Throughput per node" style="width:70%">
<figcaption><span class="caption-label">Figure 1.1:</span> Throughput per node</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="tbl-results" class="figure kind-table">
<figcaption><span class="caption-label">Table 1.1:</span> Benchmark results</figcaption>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="align-right" scope="col">Nodes</th>
<th class="align-right" scope="col">GB/s</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="align-right">1</td>
<td class="align-right">11.2</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="align-right">2</td>
<td class="align-right">20.8</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="align-right">3</td>
<td class="align-right">30.1</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
<aside class="callout callout-note" role="note">
<p class="callout-title">Reproducibility</p>
<p>Record the compiler version alongside every measurement.</p>
</aside>
<aside class="callout callout-warning" role="note">
<p class="callout-title">Check the quota first</p>
<p>Requests above eight nodes need sign-off.</p>
