<h2 id="sec-method"><span class="number">1.1</span> Method</h2>
<p>The following listing computes the mean of the recorded samples.</p>
<figure id="lst-load" class="figure kind-listing">
<figcaption><span class="caption-label">Listing 1.1:</span> Loading the data</figcaption>
<pre class="hl-code numbered"><code class="language-python"><span class="line"><span class="hl-source hl-python"><span class="hl-meta hl-qualified-name hl-python"><span class="hl-meta hl-generic-name hl-python">samples</span></span> <span class="hl-keyword hl-operator hl-assignment hl-python">=</span> <span class="hl-meta hl-sequence hl-list hl-python"><span class="hl-punctuation hl-section hl-sequence hl-begin hl-python">[</span><span class="hl-constant hl-numeric hl-float hl-decimal hl-python">11<span class="hl-punctuation hl-separator hl-decimal hl-python">.</span>2</span><span class="hl-punctuation hl-separator hl-sequence hl-python">,</span> <span class="hl-constant hl-numeric hl-float hl-decimal hl-python">20<span class="hl-punctuation hl-separator hl-decimal hl-python">.</span>8</span><span class="hl-punctuation hl-separator hl-sequence hl-python">,</span> <span class="hl-constant hl-numeric hl-float hl-decimal hl-python">30<span class="hl-punctuation hl-separator hl-decimal hl-python">.</span>1</span><span class="hl-punctuation hl-section hl-sequence hl-end hl-python">]</span></span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="hl-source hl-python"><span class="hl-meta hl-qualified-name hl-python"><span class="hl-meta hl-generic-name hl-python">mean</span></span> <span class="hl-keyword hl-operator hl-assignment hl-python">=</span> <span class="hl-meta hl-function-call hl-python"><span class="hl-meta hl-qualified-name hl-python"><span class="hl-variable hl-function hl-python"><span class="hl-support hl-function hl-builtin hl-python">sum</span></span></span></span><span class="hl-meta hl-function-call hl-arguments hl-python"><span class="hl-punctuation hl-section hl-arguments hl-begin hl-python">(</span><span class="hl-meta hl-qualified-name hl-python"><span class="hl-meta hl-generic-name hl-python">samples</span></span><span class="hl-punctuation hl-section hl-arguments hl-end hl-python">)</span></span> <span class="hl-keyword hl-operator hl-arithmetic hl-python">/</span> <span class="hl-meta hl-function-call hl-python"><span class="hl-meta hl-qualified-name hl-python"><span class="hl-variable hl-function hl-python"><span class="hl-support hl-function hl-builtin hl-python">len</span></span></span></span><span class="hl-meta hl-function-call hl-arguments hl-python"><span class="hl-punctuation hl-section hl-arguments hl-begin hl-python">(</span><span class="hl-meta hl-qualified-name hl-python"><span class="hl-meta hl-generic-name hl-python">samples</span></span><span class="hl-punctuation hl-section hl-arguments hl-end hl-python">)</span></span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="hl-source hl-python"><span class="hl-meta hl-function-call hl-python"><span class="hl-meta hl-qualified-name hl-python"><span class="hl-variable hl-function hl-python"><span class="hl-support hl-function hl-builtin hl-python">print</span></span></span></span><span class="hl-meta hl-function-call hl-arguments hl-python"><span class="hl-punctuation hl-section hl-arguments hl-begin hl-python">(</span><span class="hl-storage hl-type hl-string hl-python">f</span><span class="hl-meta hl-string hl-interpolated hl-python"><span class="hl-string hl-quoted hl-double hl-python"><span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-string hl-begin hl-python">&quot;</span></span></span><span class="hl-meta hl-string hl-interpolated hl-python"><span class="hl-string hl-quoted hl-double hl-python">Mean throughput: </span><span class="hl-meta hl-interpolation hl-python"><span class="hl-punctuation hl-section hl-interpolation hl-begin hl-python">{</span><span class="hl-source hl-python hl-embedded"><span class="hl-meta hl-qualified-name hl-python"><span class="hl-meta hl-generic-name hl-python">mean</span></span></span><span class="hl-meta hl-format-spec hl-python"><span class="hl-constant hl-other hl-format-spec hl-python">:.1f</span></span></span><span class="hl-meta hl-interpolation hl-python"><span class="hl-punctuation hl-section hl-interpolation hl-end hl-python">}</span></span><span class="hl-string hl-quoted hl-double hl-python"> GB/s<span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-string hl-end hl-python">&quot;</span></span></span><span class="hl-punctuation hl-section hl-arguments hl-end hl-python">)</span></span></span></span></code></pre>
</figure>
<p>The model is <span class="math inline" data-math-style="inline" data-tex="T(n) = W/n + c">T(n) = W/n + c</span>, with fixed overhead <span class="math inline" data-math-style="inline" data-tex="c">c</span>.</p>
<div id="eq-amdahl" class="equation numbered"><span class="math display" data-math-style="display" data-tex="T(n) = \frac{W}{n} + c">T(n) = \frac{W}{n} + c</span><span class="equation-number">(1.1)</span></div>
<div class="page-break"></div>
